      {
        "label": "About",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "brazilian art director, graphic designer and researcher. based in berlin, working on editorial design, exhibitions, visual identities, sign systems and web design."
          },
          {
            "text": "currently Head of Design at therme.art."
          },
          {
            "text": "master degree in design research, in dessau, germany. the program is a collaboration between bauhaus dessau, anhalt university and humboldt university, berlin."
          },
          {
            "text": "master degree and bachelor in architecture and urbanism at university of são paulo – school of architecture and urbanism."
          },
          {
            "text": "integrates the editorial committee and is graphic designer at contravento magazine."
          }
        ]
